 "headline": "Bournemouth Hold On Late As Vardy Sparks Leicester Comeback",
 "paragraphs": [
  "Bournemouth took control early at the Vitality Stadium. Evanilson opened the scoring in the 22nd minute, with Lewis Cook providing the assist. Cook then grabbed a goal of his own in the 26th minute, set up by Tyler Adams. Ryan Christie made it 3-0 just before half-time in the 45th minute, and Adams had a hand in that one too.",
  "Leicester refused to fade after the break. Jamie Vardy pulled one back in the 72nd minute, finishing a flick from Stephy Mavididi to make it 3-1. The visitors pushed hard in the final stretch, and Vardy and Wilfred Ndidi both had big chances late on, but the home side held firm.",
  "Leicester had more of the ball territory and fired 13 shots to Bournemouth's 10, but the hosts were clinical when it counted. Bournemouth's Adam Smith and Dean Huijsen both picked up yellow cards along the way. Bournemouth take the three points, and Leicester will be left wondering what might have been."
